sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant RC_Shell
    participant Parser
    participant Executor

    User->>RC_Shell: Enters command
    RC_Shell->>Parser: Parse command string
    Parser-->>RC_Shell: Return AST
    RC_Shell->>Executor: Execute AST
    Executor-->>RC_Shell: Return status
    RC_Shell->>User: Display output/status
